# Working files for an in-flight investigation live here so they survive a
# session while staying out of history: a session-local temporary directory
# does not outlive the session that made it, and a durable finding belongs in
# docs/hardware or the steinmarder-r300 evidence tree instead.
#
# This file and README.md are tracked; everything beside them is not.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
# The boundary snapshot a later session resumes from.
!RESUME.md
